#: app/Customizer/Customizer.php:33
msgid "Petal"
msgstr "花瓣"

#. Theme URI of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "https://github.com/jiejia/ars-petal"
msgstr "https://github.com/jiejia/ars-petal"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A bright, component-library style podcast theme: white space, bold / light mixed headlines, indigo, magenta, teal and yellow color blocks and soft glows, with a blue-gray night mode. With the A Ripple Song plugin it becomes a podcast site (featured episodes, episode archive, chapters, transcript, a site-wide player); without it, it is a plain blog theme."
msgstr "明亮的组件库官网风播客主题：大留白、粗 / 细两段混排的大标题、靛蓝 / 品红 / 青绿 / 明黄色块和柔和光晕，夜间是蓝灰深色。启用 A Ripple Song 插件后是播客站（精选节目、节目归档、章节、文字稿、全站播放器）；不启用时是普通博客主题。"

#. Author of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "jiejia"
msgstr "jiejia"

#. Author URI of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "https://github.com/jiejia/"
msgstr "https://github.com/jiejia/"

